	{
		{"bg", film=1, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="white", mode="add", time=2000, sync=1},
		{"bg", del=1, path=":bg/", file="bg_0000", time=0},
		{"cgdel", id=31, film=1, sync=1, time=2000, lv=0},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060130"},
		line=1877,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gwaaaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"His torso severed from his legs, Kahaku tumbles across the ground.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gah...! A wound like this... will heal in...”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"But having been seared raw by the heat of my blade─",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"His flesh fails to reknit itself.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“M-My... regeneration...?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Not even Mitsurugi could have─!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am not the same as Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"I level the tip of my blade at Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“H-How are you suddenly this powerful?!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I arrived at my own understanding of what 'heart and blade in concord' truly means.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The irony of the situation is not lost on me.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"From the moment I met Akari, I strove only to become my\nlord's blade─nothing more than a simple tool.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"And yet, the more time I spent with her, the more helplessly I fell in love with her, until all my actions were dictated by the whims of my passions.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I willingly sacrificed Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi, crossed an inviolable line to lay with my lord, and betrayed everything I imagined my ideal self to be.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"But only in doing so was I able to find the true answer.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Perhaps my meeting with Akari was nothing more than the first step on my journey to turn from a tool into a human.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh... Soujin...?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Akari picks herself up from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should rest.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine. Your power is flowing into me, too.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Though her skin should be ravaged by frostbite, it has nary a scratch upon it.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, can you seal Kahaku again?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll give it a shot.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Akari steps up beside me.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"She fixes Kahaku with steely eyes as he writhes on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"In his current state, there is no way he could resist Akari's magicks.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Suddenly, an intense flash of light from the Imperial Palace turns night into day.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"We momentarily turn away from Kahaku to gaze at the palace.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"What in the world was that?",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"The black snow emanating from the Barrier has come to a stop.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"In short order, the snow stops falling from the sky as well.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou and her warriors must have done it!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, all that's left is to deal with Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"We turn back to face Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I thought he would be aghast, but his expression is as complacent as ever.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"What is the meaning of this?",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Could it be that this was all part of his plan?",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Well, that sure took a bit longer than I was expecting.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Now then, time for the grand finale.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Kahaku's gaze is fixed on an object slowly rising into the sky above the palace.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's that? That round thing─”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It's the Ame no Mikagami.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you plotting, you fiend?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Shouldn't it be obvious by now? I've only ever had one goal, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The Ame no Mikagami begins to shine brightly in the hazy sky.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Bright enough that it resembles a fragment of the sun itself.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"As though scorched by the blinding light and heat, a circular area around the Ame no Mikagami is seared pitch-black.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The Ame no Mikagami is the crown jewel of House Yagi.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“A conduit capable of conveying Kuronushi-no-Ookami's voice to mere mortals.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Which means...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kahaku flips his blade, Kakuriyo, around in a reverse grip.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It is a portal connecting this world to Kuronushi-no-Ookami!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"He flings Kakuriyo through the air like a spear of darkness.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"It breaks the sound barrier and pierces the Ame no Mikagami.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"The incandescent mirror is shattered to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Leaving behind only a jet-black void.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"An unfathomably dark, unfathomably cold portal to the abyss.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Kuronushi-no-Ookami! Your vengeance is upon You!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“May You lay waste to Oomikami's world with Your divine power!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"In that instant─",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The air trembles with what seems like all the world's despair given physical form.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(...He's coming...)”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"He",
{"/font"},
" is drawing near from beyond the portal of darkness.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Though I cannot see Him, my body can sense His looming presence.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"An immense, blood-red eye opens above the skies of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Every soul beneath is surely praying that their eyes are playing tricks on them.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"But deep in their hearts, they all know that this is no illusion.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"The overwhelming force of His presence prevents anyone from denying the truth of what is happening.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"All who bear witness are consumed by a sense of awe and dread that far eclipses their meager mortal comprehension.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hah, hahaha...! Ahahahahahaha! Oh, how long I've waited!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Behold! The god scorned and trampled by the Empire, manifested into this world!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The annihilation of the Empire─nay, of all the world is nigh!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Magnificent! Never shall I behold a more beautiful vista!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“What say you, Miyaguni-san? Surely with such a sight before you, you cannot deny my claim to become your groom!?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh, how beautiful! How beautiful! ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"How",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"beautiful!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Even as Kahaku laughs, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"His",
{"/font"},
" infernal eye glowers with remorseless cold down upon the world─",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wh-What is...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Elsa freezes in place as she gapes at the monolithic eye above her.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The sheer terror of the sight has driven her to forgetfulness.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-It is Kuronushi-no-Ookami.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The warden of Ne no Kuni... and keeper of the karmic distortions...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Kotone has a vague premonition.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"─The voice I heard while I was drifting in the depths of the darkness...",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"─That was the will of Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"─He was roused from His slumber by my disturbance of the karmic distortions, and He intends to exact His vengeance upon our world.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Though she cannot prove it, she knows this to be true.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kuronushi-no-Ookami is a god, isn't He? What does He intend to do?!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever will become of Tenkyo...?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"The sound of gunshots breaks the stillness.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Seized by terror, a Republican soldier impulsively opens fire.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Thus it begins─",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"One after another, the soldiers begin firing wildly into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"As soon as they start, they are unable to be stopped.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"In their collective panic, the infantrymen scream out voicelessly as they squeeze down on their triggers.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You mustn't! We dare not to defy the gods!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, stop! Stop it!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The screams of attack aircraft tearing across the sky drown out Kotone's desperate cries.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"They unleash a barrage of missiles that explode in the center of the monolithic eye.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hold your fire! Don't shoot!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"But even Elsa's voice fails to reach her fear-stricken subordinates.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"From sea and air and land, the Republican Army unleashes the full brunt of its firepower on its solitary target─",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Enough to raze Tenkyo to the ground a hundred times over.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The incessant flashes of fire momentarily banish the darkness, and the roar of the explosions extinguishes all other noise.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"The ferocious assault is as though Tenkyo itself is screaming in defiance.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aahhh...! Such sacrilege...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Only after several minutes have passed does the onslaught come to an end.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Dark smoke blankets the sky, obscuring Kuronushi-no-Ookami from view.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is it over?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"The two stare grimly at the sky.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"A gust of wind slowly carries the smoke away─",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Revealing the same blood-red eye glowering down upon them, no different from before.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not even... a scratch...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"As Elsa stares vacantly up at the sky─",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The blazing eye flickers ever so slightly─",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Sending bolts of dark lightning arcing through the city below.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Aaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaaahhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"The earth trembles from the impact.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"All the weapons of the Republican Army are melted by the flames.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Not a single implement of destruction is spared, be it their heavy weapons or the rifles of the infantrymen.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"─Dare you to defy a god?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The divine retribution raining down upon Tenkyo seemingly poses such a challenge.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Amid the deathly silence, as the Republican Army is consumed by His purifying flames─",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"The only source of noise is Elsa's radio, discharging an endless screech of static.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is this the power of Kuronushi-no-Ookami...?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"At the sight of the Republican Army being ravaged by flames, Akari clutches at my arm.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Unable to even tremble, her hands cling feebly to my clothes.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Heheheh... That's it... It's even more beautiful than I ever imagined.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Still collapsed on the ground, Kahaku nonetheless revels in the havoc.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"His voice is tinged with heady intoxication.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Truly, all humans are at their most beautiful in the moment of their death.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The moment their limbs are torn off, the moment their bodies are lashed by hellfire, the moment their souls are ripped away from them... Ohh, their screams...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The brilliance of that one fleeting moment... it touches my heart more than all the stars in the sky above.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“What say you, Miyaguni-san? Tenkyo is most beautiful today, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-You... you dare...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make light... of such a...”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Kuronushi-no-Ookami turns His gaze towards us.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"The vast rift of sanguine fire dilates with an intense glow of power─",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Filling me with cold despair.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The same crackling void that reduced the Republican Army to ash descends down upon us.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Before the power of a god, a mere blade means nothing.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"We will surely be returned to dust before we are even able to feel any pain.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"An instantaneous death, delivered of His divine mercy.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"But I won't let it end like this.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"─I will protect Akari.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Even if it means defying a god.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"With Ame no Mitsurugi in my hands─",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"With this single, pure emotion swelling to fill every crevice of my heart─",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"What need have I to hesitate, even in the face of a god?",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"As all of Tenkyo holds its breath, I lower my center of gravity.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Putting everything into this one strike─",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"All my heart, all my soul─",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooooooaaaaaaaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I swing Ame no Mitsurugi at the arc of lightning racing towards us.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Our two forces clash with an intense explosion of power.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"A brilliant flash of light illuminates the sky above Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I refuse to be defeated.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"My muscle fibers rip, my cells rupture, but I resolutely ignore their screams.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"The souls of the eight hundred and eighty-eight priestesses that make up this body of mine─",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I turn them all to spellforce, burning them away that I might strike down the god before me.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will not be defeateeeeeddd!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Yet Kuronushi-no-Ookami has no regard for the feelings of a single human being.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The balance of power slowly tips in His favor, and the vast torrent of power descends ever closer to Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh...!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Soujin, you struggle against the inevitable!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Now show me! Show me Tenkyo's five million lives burning to a crisp!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"He is too far to see, but I can tell.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"The person holding that unfathomable power at bay must be Onii-sama.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"He is protecting all of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"All on his own...",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"His body must be screaming in agony.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Yet all I can do is pray as I watch on.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(...)”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"How worthless I am.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Even though I swore to protect the Empire until the day Akari-sama returned!",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"All I can do is pray.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"But if that is all I can do, I will pour everything─",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"All my body and soul, all my life into this prayer.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I kneel down and face the sky.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Breathing in so hard that my chest threatens to burst, I attune my heart to the exalted being that exists high above our world.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hear me, Oomikami, all the Emperors of the past.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The eighty-seventh sovereign of the Empire, Empress Hisui, beseeches Thee.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"In the end, I am nothing but an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"But right now─",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Just for now, as all of Tenkyo hangs in the balance, please accept my prayer as the true Empress of this realm.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"I gladly offer all my life.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"I gladly accept an eternity of torments unending in exchange.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"If my life has even the slightest value, I lay it at Your feet.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"All I ask is that You protect Tenkyo─",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Protect Onii-sama.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Please...",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Please!",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Kuronushi-no-Ookami's power mercilessly shaves away at my spellforce.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"My sense of pain was the first to be ablated, with my vision and hearing following soon after.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"─Is this to be the end?",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"─Am I to fall here, having failed to protect that which I must?",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"The moment hesitation begins to seize my heart, the scales of our contest tip at once.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"My power vanishes in an instant, and His wrath descends down upon me.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
".........",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"But the impact never comes.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What in the...”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"The bolts of cracking void that threatened to annihilate Tenkyo have been nullified in midair.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"All around me, the gravestones of all the Emperors past are bathed in a pale, divine light.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Their magicks have raised an aegis to protect Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, you mustn't give in yet.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chihaya...?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“The fate of the Empire hangs in the balance.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“In answering the prayers of Empress Hisui, I and the eighty-six Emperors of the past have been summoned to lend you our aid.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami...”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"The Emperors of the past─",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"They who are heirs to the legacy left behind by me, Himi-no-Mikoto, and Chihaya are protecting the Empire from Kuronushi-no-Ookami's wrath.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"I have to use this time to think.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"What can I do to banish Kuronushi-no-Ookami?",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(Soujin-sama... Soujin-sama...)”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Deep within my mind, a faint voice rings out.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone?!”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The thread that binds our souls together... it still remains.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where are you? Are you safe?!”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Worry not about me... but about Kuronushi-no-Ookami.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How can I defeat Him?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was contemplating that as well, but I eventually came to realize that such thinking is mistaken.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We mere humans cannot hope to harm a god.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ours is but to revere and pray with wholehearted sincerity... that we might pacify His anger.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That has always been the relationship between god and humanity.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was Sekka-san... who taught me that.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"That priestess taught ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"her?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Please... I beg you...”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"With her last, desperate plea, the connection between us is severed.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I don't know what is happening where she is, but Kotone expended the last of her power to deliver that message to me.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Cracks begin to appear across the aegis enshielding Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"I'm nearly out of time.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"What can I do to quell Kuronushi-no-Ookami's anger?",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Kuronushi-no-Ookami is enraged that His dominion of Ne no Kuni has been reduced to a dumping ground for karmic distortions.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"What, then, can I offer that will appease Him?",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...!”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Only one answer comes to mind.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“O great Kuronushi-no-Ookami, I humbly seek to make a proposition!”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"I scream at the top of my lungs.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"But Kuronushi-no-Ookami pays me no heed.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"The voice of a mere warrior cannot hope to be heard by a god.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, what are you thinking?!”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll make Kuronushi-no-Ookami an offering, and implore Him to return to Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...That's it! If you do the talking, He just might agree to hear your request.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where's this coming from? What're you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone's wisdom showed me the way.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only way to make Kuronushi-no-Ookami withdraw is to present Him an offering that will appease His wrath.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you intending to offer?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll offer myself.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will follow Him to Ne no Kuni and cut down every last karmic distortion.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you even saying...? Are you insane?!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fortunately, I have eternal life. I will not die and leave my covenant unfulfilled.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Wait a second!”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Listen to me.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"I place my hands on Akari's shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In exchange for me going to Ne no Kuni, I want you to propose that He take back all the karmic distortions that entered into this world.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course, that includes Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that happens, it will all be over.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Both Kahaku and the black snow will be banished to Ne no Kuni, and this world will be purified.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hold it right there! I won't let you decide all this without me.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"Kahaku protests, scrabbling against the ground without his lower body.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You shut your mouth!”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"I drive Ame no Mitsurugi through his chest, pinning him to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"He will interrupt us no more.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Guh...! Soujin... Do you have any idea what you're even─”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, make up your mind.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But what'll happen to you?!”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will not rest until I've cut down all the karmic distortions in Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But, that... That means you'll never be able to...!”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll return to you once my task is complete.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"But that is a lie.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Kahaku and I are an inseverable pair.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Even if I did manage to cut down all the karmic distortions, he is the one thing I cannot kill.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Therefore, I will never be able to return. He and I will continue our struggle in Ne no Kuni unto eternity.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What am I going to do if you go away?!”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Am I supposed to live on without you?!”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's right.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll cast it aside.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In order to protect you, I'll cast it all aside.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Empire, my duty, my friends, myself...”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And even you.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... You...”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is the only way.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take your place as the Imperial Princess and protect the Empire. That is your duty.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“After all we've done, you're still gonna bring up duty?!”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We killed the Founding Empress and Mitsurugi for the sake of our love!”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We've made a complete mockery of our duties... and you told me you didn't regret a thing...”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So stay with me... to the very end!”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"I cannot bring myself to respond.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Oh, how truly wonderful it would have been if we'd been able to betray our duties to the end.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A single warrior, or all five million residents of Tenkyo. It goes without saying which is more important.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For the sake of the Empire, you must cast me aside.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Cast me aside, and know you've done the right thing.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How can I...”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am willing to cast everything aside and become an avatar that exists only to destroy karmic distortions.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Akari bites down on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"I can feel the turmoil racing through her body.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari... Let me call you my lord to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you still remember the day I pledged my fealty to you here?”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What I seek from my lord is...”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Courage.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"Akari whispers softly.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The courage to entrust my fate to my subjects, the courage to send my vassals into battle...”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And the courage to see things through to the end... no matter the outcome.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. That's right.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"Akari grits her teeth as she desperately holds back the feelings surging up within her.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's not fair, Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When you put it like that, how am I ever supposed to whine about it?”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Swallowing my apology, I show her a smile instead.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I expect nothing less from my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"Thinking about it, our circumstances truly go beyond any irony or farce.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"We trampled all over our duties for the sake of our love, only to desperately try and cling to that path once more.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"But no matter. I will cast those feelings aside and return to being a tool that lives only to serve its purpose.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"What have the two of us gained from this yearlong journey?",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Did we take one step forward only to take two steps back?",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"Or perhaps the opposite?",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"─No, the outcome doesn't matter in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Though I was born a tool, I came to love another, and found that which I must protect.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"And even now, her warmth is graven upon my body as a memory that shall never fade.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"That is why I do not hesitate to cast myself to eternal battle in Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"I fight not to fulfill my purpose, not because I am a warrior─",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"But of my own free will.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...Hahahaha! So this is how it all turns out in the end.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Whether the Empress or Mitsurugi or little ol' me, we're all just tools of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“We cast aside our hearts, cast aside our tears, all so that generation after generation of strangers can watch us dance for them!”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Round and round we go... Ahaha, ahahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll hear no more mockery out of a beast like you, without a heart to even speak of!”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"The incandescent fury of her glare is enough to make even Kahaku hold his tongue.",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"The cracks in the canopy grow wider and wider.",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"The aegis will shatter in no time at all.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I will never cast aside my feelings for you.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Instead, I'll lock them up in a box and seal it away in the deepest recesses of my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All in order to become a worthy Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"That is all she can do to defy her inescapable destiny.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			{
"Having found her resolve, there is no more hesitation in her clear eyes.",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"Her gaze lingers on mine for just a few more seconds, but then─",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"She kneels on the ground and turns her gaze upwards to look at Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hear me, great lord of Ne no Kuni, Kuronushi-no-Ookami.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The child of Empress Suou, Tsukisome-no-Himemiko, humbly presumes to make a proposition.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Akari's clarion voice rings out across the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your wrath at the defilement of Your dominion by our karmic distortions is eminently justified.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hence, I wish to make amends by dispatching my servant, Tokita Soujin, to Your realm that he might cut down the karmic distortions.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As Tokita is undying, he shall not expire without fulfilling this covenant.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I give you my solemn word that he shall not rest until they have been cut down to the last.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, I beg You, withdraw to Your dominion.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes stare straight into Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I would ask but one thing in return.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please take the karmic distortions that have spilled into this world back to Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Every last one, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"without exception!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			{
"Akari makes a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"Please, let her petition reach Him.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"If He will not hear even the Crown Princess's voice, then there is nothing more that we can do.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"I stare up at the sky, desperately hoping, praying─",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"The darkness that threatened to consume the world begins to lose its vigor.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"At the same moment, the aegis that enshielded Tenkyo dissipates as its magicks fade.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"Akari's voice has reached Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"Even He cannot ignore an entreaty from the Empress who rules the country in Oomikami's stead.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Heh... Haha! You did it, Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Impossible... How could it come to this?”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kahaku, you're coming with me.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"Kahaku is still pinned to the ground by Ame no Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			{
"Without his lower body, he is helpless to resist.",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Curse it all!”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"In the next instant─",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"The monolithic eye extends forth an enormous, inhuman arm.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"Mighty enough to crush even the moon in its grasp, it seizes me and Kahaku off the ground.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ah... ah, aaah...”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"Akari's scream momentarily stays Kuronushi-no-Ookami's hand.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"I look down at her from high above as she cranes her head to meet my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"Come to think of it, this is the very same hill upon which I swore my fealty to Akari this spring.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"How fitting that I should meet my end where my journey first began.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"Perhaps all of it was ordained by the fates.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"As I close my eyes, memories as numerous as the stars themselves race through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"Days where we battled desperately for our lives, days we wasted away at school like ordinary students─",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"In contrast to my unmoving heart of stone, Akari was always tempestuous, passionate beyond measure, capable of countless expressions as rich and vibrant as the seasons of the Empire.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"Expressions like the new growth of spring, overflowing with tenderness─",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"Expressions like the radiant midsummer sun, bursting with fervorous ardor─",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"Expressions like the shifting autumn leaves, tinged with melancholy─",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"Expressions like the unyielding winds of winter, braced with cold resolution─",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"Each one is indelibly graven upon my heart.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			{
"Has there ever been a year as unforgettably vivid as this?",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"No. Never.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			{
"It was only through the grace of Akari's boundless expressions that I was granted a heart of flesh.",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"From the very start, I was utterly captivated, drawn in closer and closer─",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			{
"Until I overstepped that inviolable line, claimed her lips as my own, and consummated our passions.",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"Her warmth, seared upon my body, still burns within me, even now.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
"So long as it remains with me, I'll never freeze, not even in that world of remorseless winter.",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			{
"Thank you, Akari.",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			{
"You are what made me human.",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"You are my one and only sun.",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is goodbye.”",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How... how can you smile?”",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			{
"Am I? I didn't realize.",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I go willingly, for the sake of the one I love most.”",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nothing could make me more proud.”",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			{
"For you, Akari, I go. For you, and perhaps for that new life yet to be born.",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"How could I possibly have any regrets?",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for giving me a reason to smile.”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't want... your thanks...”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			{
"Akari bites down on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't you promise you wouldn't cry anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are my one and only lord.”",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Send me off with a smile.”",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"Akari shows me a truly terrible smile.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			{
"Of all the countless expressions she's shown me, this must be the clumsiest of them all.",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now I won't freeze, even in the snow.”",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"Truly, I have no more regrets.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"Akari tenderly narrows her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In the name of Tsukisome-no-Himemiko, heed my command, Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Promise you'll return to me.”",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll protect the Empire until that day comes.”",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			{
"I shall never return.",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			{
"But that is all the more reason─",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			{
"I must tell my lord one final lie.",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
